# Audit-Beta brief — wave <k>, <category> batch (steps A1/A2/A4)

> **NO SHELL-PERMISSION PROMPTS (owner, 2026-07-30) — binding on every current
> and future agent.** Use commands already allowed inside the workspace sandbox;
