      "claim": "By induction, $|s_k| = 1$ for every $k$: the base case is $|s_0| = |1| = 1$, and if $|s_k| = 1$ then $|s_{\\sigma(k)}| = |-s_k| = |s_k| = 1$. Hence $|s_k| \\le 1$ for every $k$, so $(s_k)$ is bounded. [L1, L2, L8]",
