Disk verification shows A1/A2 completed cleanly for the sole 18-item A page, and A3 now authorizes the exact A4 set. Broken NKU/CUHK URLs were independently rechecked and will be omitted/replaced before retagging.
  ✓ Recover normative audit rules and verify active wave-4 scope/ownership from disk
