codex
The source recheck changed the ledger in one substantive way: the canonical NKU PDF still could not be fetched, and the CUHK PDF returned 502, so neither will enter reader-facing frontmatter. The remaining Hunter/OpenStax/CMU/Reed sources resolve; for `lem-index-map-grows`, a University of Wisconsin course page explicitly states the needed \(n_k\ge k\) clause and replaces CUHK. I’m recording those observed statuses in the affected ledger rationales before touching content.
