+strictly increasing, $s_{n_j} = 1$ for every $j$, and $(s_k)$ does not
+converge.
 
 The sequence usually written $x_k = (-1)^k$ is introduced here by recursion
 ([[thm-recursion]]), as the unique $(s_k)$ with $s_0 = 1$ and
